# Drivers for devices that appear after boot: a USB Wi-Fi stick, a dock, a
# headset. palm-modules opens the kernel's uevent socket, walks /sys once
# (anything palm-init's own coldplug missed), then loads a module for every
# new device with a modalias. Installed by the linux package as
# /etc/palm/services/modules.
cmd     = /usr/bin/palm-modules watch
restart = always
